I suck at creating backgrounds and such. <br /> <br /> This is my character sheet.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B3MaDlLEDWYsTmVsVGlEcjI2QkE/view?ths=true\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B3M.../view?ths=true</a> comments are appreciated.<br /> <br /> I am reading up on Dream.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T17:31:34-07:00","id":1078663,"title":"","content":"555 N. Central Ave is in the heart of Phoenix, you are correct.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T17:34:00-07:00","id":1078664,"title":"","content":"Yes for a starting character that is correct but this is a character with experience points so it is no longer starting. I was using that as an example of making sure that 3 dots go in fate and not caring where the other 3 went for the example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T17:57:45-07:00","id":1078674,"title":"","content":"I've scouted Phoenix for possible places to make Ignis' shop and a basement Sanctum. Would this place work within your chronicle?<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.google.pt/maps/@33.4510666,-112.0737989,3a,15y,306.42h,84.73t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sA8BqLsPfvKhpe-XappL2YQ!2e0!7i13312!8i6656\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps/api/staticmap?center=33.4510666%2C-112.0737989&amp;zoom=27&amp;size=900x900&amp;language=en&amp;sensor=false&amp;key=AIzaSyBoYjeRtfVI0Jd8Q_9mnflo9i4sOYpShB0&amp;signature=3Yqgh3fraqjEQs_wzeCiRGEtMo0\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.google.pt/maps/@33.4510666,-112.0737989,3a,15y,306.42h,84.73t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sA8BqLsPfvKhpe-XappL2YQ!2e0!7i13312!8i6656\" target=\"_blank\"> Google Maps </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.google.pt/maps/@33.4510666,-112.0737989,3a,15y,306.42h,84.73t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sA8BqLsPfvKhpe-XappL2YQ!2e0!7i13312!8i6656\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.google.pt/maps/@33.4510666,-112.0737989,3a,15y,306.42h,84.73t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sA8BqLsPfvKhpe-XappL2YQ!2e0!7i13312!8i6656 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Find local businesses, view maps and get driving directions in Google Maps. </div> </div> </div><br /> As it is near the ASU it would be good for Fictional Destiny, and it works for Ignis as it has a good store front. Also as there is the possibility of the Cabal living upstairs it seems a good location.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T17:58:07-07:00","id":1078675,"title":"","content":"Legacy as it exists so far [PEACH]:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-b3N6VzRDeFJ1czQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-b3N6VzRDeFJ1czQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-b3N6VzRDeFJ1czQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-b3N6VzRDeFJ1czQ/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> My character so far:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-TEd3QVI5bUZONkk/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-TEd3QVI5bUZONkk/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-TEd3QVI5bUZONkk/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-TEd3QVI5bUZONkk/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Let me know if anything doesn't work","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","name":"Fictional Dynasty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T18:31:30-07:00","id":1078689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fictional Dynasty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078637#post1078637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> How do you feel about legacies? I ask because I like the idea of my character founding their own legacy. I've been working on a homebrew but I'm new to the system and might not be able to tell if something is over powered (or under powered). I'm not even finished the first draft yet so if you say no to the whole idea that's fine. It's just a thought.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know I'm not involved in the game that's brewing up, but I love talking legacies. Obviously Hardwire has final say, but I'm willing to help out with that.<br /> <br /> For instance, I'm noticing you called Reach by another name, Shifts isn't a thing. Know Nature has to contend with Withstand so it may not be able to give you all of that info until you raise Mind to a sufficient level (Depending on the target's Withstand), and you already spent the Reach on Instant so it won't provide info on their Manipulation.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure how the 2nd attainment works...<br /> <br /> 3rd attainment might be fine. I'd at least make a note you can't get a Beat by resolving the Inspired Condition, and I'd make the Mind part have to overcome Withstand, no note on how Reach was spent but I'd suggest Advanced Duration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 04-14-2017, 09:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T18:38:48-07:00","id":1078693,"title":"","content":"This is a copy of the updated Character Sheet. I added 3 points to Cabal Merits, 1 point to Gnosis for 4. I added 1 point to Fate for 4. I added 1 point to Time for 3. I added 1 point to Space for 2. I did not take Dream because I needed the points elsewhere. I wanted to put points into the cabal. I didn't put as much as I wanted. If someone sees a mistake I made, please tell me.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B3MaDlLEDWYsQllCeG4yRm5fT3c/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B3MaDlLEDWYsQllCeG4yRm5fT3c/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B3MaDlLEDWYsQllCeG4yRm5fT3c/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B3MaDlLEDWYsQllCeG4yRm5fT3c/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T18:42:25-07:00","id":1078694,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2632\" data-vbnamecard=\"2632\">Mrmdubois</a> I'd appreciate your input.<br /> <br /> I'm particularly concerned that Moment of Truth might be too powerful. Especially the optional benefit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","name":"Fictional Dynasty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T18:47:42-07:00","id":1078697,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fictional Dynasty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078694#post1078694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2632\" data-vbnamecard=\"2632\">Mrmdubois</a> I'd appreciate your input.<br /> <br /> I'm particularly concerned that Moment of Truth might be too powerful. Especially the optional benefit.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm more concerned about not knowing how the 2nd one works honestly. Since you don't have notes about how Reach is spent in the 3rd it looks like you may have to be touching the target to be able to bypass their Withstand. As to if it's too powerful or not that should be <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> to make that call, I'm just trying to iron out how everything works in the first place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T18:53:26-07:00","id":1078698,"title":"","content":"Sorry if the wording is unclear; it is a first draft. My Idea for the second one was using a 'One Mind, Two Thoughts' like ability to give yourself a teamwork bonus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","name":"Fictional Dynasty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T19:03:43-07:00","id":1078706,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fictional Dynasty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078698#post1078698\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry if the wording is unclear; it is a first draft. My Idea for the second one was using a 'One Mind, Two Thoughts' like ability to give yourself a teamwork bonus.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm, that should be doable, I think you should use those exact words and stick to it only working on Extended Mental tasks and then activate it via a ritual (The task) and spend the Reach on Advanced Duration to cover the length of the entire task. To go the route of giving yourself teamwork on two Instant Mental actions you would have to spend the one free Reach on ritual activation still.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T19:04:18-07:00","id":1078707,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078689#post1078689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I know I'm not involved in the game that's brewing up, but I love talking legacies. Obviously Hardwire has final say, but I'm willing to help out with that.<br /> <br /> For instance, I'm noticing you called Reach by another name, Shifts isn't a thing. Know Nature has to contend with Withstand so it may not be able to give you all of that info until you raise Mind to a sufficient level (Depending on the target's Withstand), and you already spent the Reach on Instant so it won't provide info on their Manipulation.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure how the 2nd attainment works...<br /> <br /> 3rd attainment might be fine. I'd at least make a note you can't get a Beat by resolving the Inspired Condition, and I'd make the Mind part have to overcome Withstand, no note on how Reach was spent but I'd suggest Advanced Duration.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can join if you want, you are welcome.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11807_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11807\" data-vbnamecard=\"11807\">HTaiji</a> That location is in downtown Phoenix which is 20+ miles from ASU (Roughly). Downtown Phoenix is expensive to try and have a storefront it. It will chew up a resources 2 for the Monthly overhead. There are very few basements in Down town (or in any of Phoenix as far as that goes) as Phoenix is built on Sans and Clay, because of this most building have pre-stressed foundations that make it near impossible to do a basement. Buildings that do have basements have them specially designed to take the stress and even they need frequent repair.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T19:09:01-07:00","id":1078709,"title":"","content":"If I may give my input, to be able to use an Attainment reflexively, especially to give 9-again to a Spell seems too overpowered. If it was a bonus to the first spell cast before Duration expires would be better, I believe.<br /> For the first part, if I understand correctly it's a &quot;roll Intelligence + Skill, apply successes as dice bonus to next action with the same Skill&quot; right? Again, don't make it apply to the same turn, better for it to apply the bonus to the next action before Duration expires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T19:56:26-07:00","id":1078723,"title":"","content":"Well, here's my character. <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B0YUp_a_XTCkazltalBFMDRaeVk\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B0...zltalBFMDRaeVk</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> hmmm... well, I have the Resources 2 so, that won't be a problem, but forking off Res 2 might be a problem down the road... how about here?<br /> <a href=\"https://www.google.pt/maps/place/299+S+Central+Ave,+Phoenix,+AZ+85004,+EUA/@33.4452525,-112.0737186,3a,60y,89.49h,75.72t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sYbQBL-Qkm9saOqI4NSAF9A!2e0!7i13312!8i6656!4m13!1m7!3m6!1s0x872b122062e55a1b:0x6f2af25b1b65d989!2s1+W+Jackson+St,+Phoenix,+AZ+85003,+EUA!3b1!8m2!3d33.444538!4d-112.074323!3m4!1s0x872b12205d232a2d:0x517a2e27c0785630!8m2!3d33.4452362!4d-112.0737899!6m1!1e1\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.google.pt/maps/place/299...737899!6m1!1e1</a><br /> It would be a place kinda like Dresden Files (TV Series, not the books) with store front one side, living quarters the other, with an extra concealed (and warded) room for the Sanctum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11807,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","user":"HTaiji","date":". 04-14-2017, 10:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T20:04:15-07:00","id":1078726,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078707#post1078707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can join if you want, you are welcome