ynasty","name":"Fictional Dynasty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T22:37:01-07:00","id":1078770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078740#post1078740\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would probably be 1600 EDT every other Saturday. It is still several weeks before i would be ready to start. And it looks like it will be on Discord.</div> </div> </div> </div>Might work then. I'll have a hard think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T22:40:30-07:00","id":1078771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fictional Dynasty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078741#post1078741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How does this look?<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-LUU5MXNySVRsQWM/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9d...ew?usp=sharing</a><br /> I cleaned up a bit of the wording and added a fourth attainment</div> </div> </div> </div>2nd attainment is a lot clearer, and 4th attainment looks like it works.<br /> <br /> 2nd attainment doesn't need the bit about it being a day, Advanced Duration will bump up as your Arcana increases, and attainments not being part of spell control means by Mastery you could have a lot of year long instances of self-induced teamwork running simultaneously for specific extended mental tasks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T23:24:55-07:00","id":1078782,"title":"","content":"Wow, this thing is definitely progressing!<br /> <br /> I took a close look at the other three character sheets and found a few things that seemed slightly off. A couple of them are more my opinion, but hopefully what I have to say about them is still helpful.<br /> 1. It seems Ignis has spent 19 xp, not 20. I count 6 merit dots above starting (6xp), 1 arcana dot above starting (4xp), 1 gnosis above starting (5xp since merits weren't traded for gnosis), and 2 skill dots above starting (4xp).<br /> 2. Doctor Luck should have a second obsession<br /> 3. (opinion) Doctor Luck's obsession with mastering all the arcana seems a bit too general. It's an incredibly encompassing goal, especially when you consider the fact that even third degree masters are extremely rare. Something more reasonable would be mastering his path arcana.<br /> 4. (opinion) Fandisto's goal of bedding as many supernatural creatures as possible is definitely stretching the limit of the definition of &quot;encountering certain strangeness in the world.&quot; (quoted portion from page 83 of the core rule book). It honestly reads more like an aspiration to me. An actual supernatural phenomenon related to sexual encounters with supernatural creatures would make a little bit more sense.<br /> 5. (opinion) It sounds like Fandisto might be more attracted to the Adamantine Arrow than the Mysterium, just based on his concept and his aspirations. This isn't to say he should be in that order, but rather that it could be possible internal conflict for him (aka, drama and a plot thread for the game!).<br /> 6. Doctor Luck and Fandisto should have one and two more praxes respectively.<br /> 7. Doctor Luck has a merit that says Order Adamantine Arrow. If that is supposed to be status Adamantine arrow, you might want to fix that. If that is meant to represent that he is actually a part of the arrow, you'll want to state that it is status as well as change his order up in the order box. Otherwise you'll need to change the merit to status Mysterium.<br /> <br /> My reasoning for 3 and 4 is based in my belief that obsessions should relate to supernatural phenomena. In other words I believe that they often should be advanced by solving and understanding certain Mysteries (how much solving any particular Mystery helps is between the player and the gm). Mastering all the arcana is so incredibly broad that solving any Mystery would advance it. Bedding as many supernatural creatures as one can, on the other hand, has (at least in my mind) very, very little to do with directly experiencing the Mysteries.<br /> <br /> I'm basically done with the structure of my character, gotta still work some on the fluff. Still trying to work through how to use that interactive pdf, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7825,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","user":"Falcon777","date":". 04-15-2017, 02:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T23:50:15-07:00","id":1078784,"title":"","content":"Rechecked my character sheet, last point was spent on an extra Rote (Telekinesis) :P also, have some goodies for you all, since insomnia is a real problem and it's 7:30 on this side of the Atlantic. Got ST clearance for a sweet spot downtown, East Madison Street, just 15min walking distance from Fandisto's college. Spent the insomniac hours furnishing the loft.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B0YUp_a_XTCkNmtkTURTeFJFVDQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B0YUp_a_XTCkNmtkTURTeFJFVDQ\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B0YUp_a_XTCkNmtkTURTeFJFVDQ\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B0YUp_a_XTCkNmtkTURTeFJFVDQ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> As for Mastering all Arcana, it's not so much an obsession as it's a lofty goal. Sure, it's the obsession to understand all, but focus it a bit. Start by understanding the few before attempting the many. Which Arcana call to you? Why? What parts of it do you wanna Master? Bedding every supernatural creature is a bit too focused, but works in the sense of &quot;let me see how different creatures experience sex, and how that will color my experience&quot; the pursuit of understanding their psyche through pleasure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T02:53:16-07:00","id":1078815,"title":"","content":"Ah, I missed the rote. Sorry about that. Btw, does anyone know what program I need in order to use the interactive pdf character sheets? I can download them fine, but they act as read only documents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T03:30:23-07:00","id":1078818,"title":"","content":"Do you have a yellow bar across the top of the sheet with allow editing or something similar. All it should take is Adobe Reader.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T03:52:35-07:00","id":1078823,"title":"","content":"My two extra Praxis were subsumed into legacy atainments as per the rules on page 199. Hence the two arcane beats. That might be cheatering though, to do that pregame. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> is that cheatering?<br /> <br /> P.S. I made a fifth attainment if y'all want to check it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1081,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","user":"Fictional Dynasty","date":". 04-15-2017, 07:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","name":"Fictional Dynasty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T05:10:24-07:00","id":1078841,"title":"","content":"Here is a link to my updated character sheet. I still have to figure and rearrange praxis.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsQllCeG4yRm5fT3c\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsQllCeG4yRm5fT3c\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsQllCeG4yRm5fT3c\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsQllCeG4yRm5fT3c </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T05:23:50-07:00","id":1078844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fictional Dynasty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078741#post1078741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How does this look?<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-LUU5MXNySVRsQWM/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-LUU5MXNySVRsQWM/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-LUU5MXNySVRsQWM/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-LUU5MXNySVRsQWM/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> I cleaned up a bit of the wording and added a fourth attainment</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Give me a write up on the La Pravecistoj stating the purpose, goals, and theories of the legacy, How do you see them and their intended purpose. I know that you created them and that you are the only one that is in the Legacy but you still created them to fill some role in the awakened community or some role in your life. What was the driving force behind the Legacy. I have not delved to deeply into the Legacy yet but there are a few comments of things that leaped out to me as I skimmed it. One you get the write-up to me then I can better judge the Legacy.<br /> <br /> <b>Prerequisites of the Legacy:</b> This is a Mental Legacy why the Prerequisite of Athletics. To me the Athletics doesn't fit in the list.<br /> <br /> <b>Identity Deceivers:</b> At the moment there is no issue with the first level Attainment or the Optional Attainment But once again I have only done a cursory look and will take second look after I receive the write-up.<br /> <br /> <b>Flow of Truth:</b> It cannot be used at the same time as you are casting a spell as it is currently written. As stated on page 213 under Actions, &quot;an instant action takes up your turn&quot;, activating an Attainment is an instant action and casting a spell would be a second instant action. For a +2 reach the Attainment can be turned into a reflexive action. I also do not like the fact that it would give you a permanent 9-Again on all spell rolls. So that would be a no on it being a second level optional attainment for Prime, I would entertain the Idea of allowing it as the 4th level attainment. Also Optional Attainments <u><i>should</i></u> build off or be related to the primary attainment of that level or a lesser level. I am still mulling over the Teamwork aspect of the Attainment, on one hand you would have a permanent bonus to the Skills listed as a prerequisite, Not a fan of that, on the other hand it is only a small list of skills. If you change it to a set +1 at mind 3 and below and a +2 at mind 4 and above then i would feel better about the Attainment (As long as you remove the Athletics from the prerequisite list, no skill on the list that isn't mental or social)<br /> <br /> <b>Moment of Truth:</b> I do not find any mind spell that grants the informed condition, not saying that there can't be. Conditions is more of a Fate thing, not their purview just has a Fate Feel, however I can see it fitting here for this so no issue at the moment, as long as it is for non-spellcasting rolls. Just as with the Fate Spell Exceptional Luck it is a +2 reach to have the informed condition affect a spellcasting roll. I will give more thought on the issue. Not sure I understand the 3rd Attainment Optional Prime ability, how is Prime helping you bypass Withstand of a Spell? I realize that you are resolving the Informed condition to get an Exceptional Success* on the roll and using the bonus from the Exceptional Success to bypass withstand. But what is Prime needed for to make this happen?<br /> <br /> <b>Speak the Hearts Truth:</b> At the moment the only issue is with the Optional Attainment, Attainment can stack with spells but not other Attainments. The Transient Stacking, page 199, mentions &quot;Transient stacking can only be performed on <u><i><b>spells</b></i></u> lingering within the mage\u2019s own Gnosis&quot;, by definition Attainments are not spells. However you can have the attainment open 4 doors. It would not reduce the duration as explained in your write-up, as it is no longer stacking.<br /> <br /> *<i>BTW Since there is no roll with an Attainments they can not have Exceptional Successes, I realize that this is affecting a spell that you are casting and not the attainment itself so this doesn't apply but just thought I would throw that out there.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T05:25:01-07:00","id":1078845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fictional Dynasty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078823#post1078823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My two extra Praxis were subsumed into legacy atainments as per the rules on page 199. Hence the two arcane beats. That might be cheatering though, to do that pregame. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> is that cheatering?<br /> <br /> P.S. I made a fifth attainment if y'all want to check it out.</div> </div> </div> </div>No please don't do that. Spend the experience to gain those Attainments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T05:59:39-07:00","id":1078850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078844#post1078844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Give me a write up on the La Pravecistoj stating the purpose, goals, and theories of the legacy, How do you see them and their intended purpose. I know that you created them and that you are the only one that is in the Legacy but you still created them to fill some role in the awakened community or some role in your life. What was the driving force behind the Legacy. I have not delved to deeply into the Legacy yet but there are a few comments of things that leaped out to me as I skimmed it. One you get the write-up to me then I can better judge the Legacy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I will get on this asap<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078844#post1078844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Prerequisites of the Legacy:</b> This is a Mental Legacy why the Prerequisite of Athletics. To me the Athletics doesn't fit in the list.</div> </div> </div> </div>I figured there should be at least one physical skill and that fit best. I can change it if you really want but I personally like it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078844#post1078844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Identity Deceivers:</b> At the moment there is no issue with the first level Attainment or the Optional Attainment But once again I have only done a cursory look and will take second look after I receive the write-up.<br /> <br /> <b>Flow of Truth:</b> It cannot be used at the same time as you are casting a spell as it is currently written. As stated on page 213 under Actions, &quot;an instant action takes up your turn&quot;, activating an Attainment is an instant action and casting a spell would be a second instant action. For a +2 reach the Attainment can be turned into a reflexive action. I also do not like the fact that it would give you a permanent 9-Again on all spell rolls. So that would be a no on it being a second level optional attainment for Prime, I would entertain the Idea of allowing it as the 4th level attainment. Also Optional Attainments <u><i>should</i></u> build off or be related to the primary attainment of that level or a lesser level. I am still mulling over the Teamwork aspect of the Attainment, on one hand you would have a permanent bonus to the Skills listed as a prerequisite, Not a fan of that, on the other hand it is only a small list of skills. If you change it to a set +1 at mind 3 and below and a +2 at mind 4 and above then i would feel better about the Attainment (As long as you remove the Athletics from the prerequisite list, no skill on the list that isn't mental or social)</div> </div> </div> </div>People seem to be missing the fact that it can only affect spells that are cast in one turn using exactly one yantra. And only yantra that can be enchanted so &quot;the noonday sun&quot; and even mudras are not allowed. That seems like a big enough disadvantage to justify combined casting. If it isn't, I can change it as you say.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078844#post1078844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Moment of Truth:</b> I do not find any mind spell that grants the informed condition, not saying that there can't be. Conditions is more of a Fate thing, not their purview just has a Fate Feel, however I can see it fitting here for this so no issue at the moment, as long as it is for non-spellcasting rolls. Just as with the Fate Spell Exceptional Luck it is a +2 reach to have the informed condition affect a spellcasting roll. I will give more thought on the issue. Not sure I understand the 3rd Attainment Optional Prime ability, how is Prime helping you bypass Withstand of a Spell? I realize that you are resolving the Informed condition to get an Exceptional Success* on the roll and using the bonus from the Exceptional Success to bypass withstand. But what is Prime needed for to make this happen?</div> </div> </div> </div>Prime is used to alter and empower other magic. It seems like a bit of an edge case but legacy attainments are supposed to be a little weird, aren't they?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078844#post1078844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Speak the Hearts Truth:</b> At the moment the only issue is with the Optional Attainment, Attainment can stack with spells but not other Attainments. The Transient Stacking, page 199, mentions &quot;Transient stacking can only be performed on <u><i><b>spells</b></i></u> lingering within the mage\u2019s own Gnosis&quot;, by definition Attainments are not spells. However you can have the attainment open 4 doors. It would not reduce the duration as explained in your write-up, as it is no longer stacking.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool. I will change it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078844#post1078844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*<i>BTW Since there is no roll with an Attainments they can not have Exceptional Successes, I realize that this is affecting a spell that you are casting and not the attainment itself so this doesn't apply but just thought I would throw that out there.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","name":"Fictional Dynasty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T06:32:03-07:00","id":1078857,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fictional Dynasty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078850#post1078850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I figured there should be at least one physical skill and that fit best. I can change it if you really want but I personally like it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes please remove it, Physical does not belong in a mental Legacy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fictional Dynasty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078850#post1078850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">People seem to be missing the fact that it can only affect spells that are cast in one turn using exactly one yantra. And only yantra that can be enchanted so &quot;the noonday sun&quot; and even mudras are not allowed. That seems like a big enough disadvantage to justify combined casting. If it isn't, I can change it as you say.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not missing the limitations that are put on the attainment I am saying that I do not like you having a permanent 9-Again roll on any spell that has a physical Yantra. I will have to say that as long as that is in there the legacy is not approved.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fictional Dynasty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078850#post1078850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Prime is used to alter and empower other magic. It seems like a bit of an edge case but legacy attainments are supposed to be a little weird, aren't they?</div> </div> </div> </div>But it is not needed to resolve the condition, it is a wasted slot, keep it if you wish but it has not benefit. It cannot be the catalyst that allows the Informed condition to affect a spell, if that is what you were thinking.<br /> <br /> I am sorry if my stance on this seems a little hard nosed but I have to think of the game balance, and weed out things that I feel will cause a great deal of heartache in the Chronicle, and I feel that some of this is unbalanced.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T07:11:57-07:00","id":1078873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078857#post1078857\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am sorry if my stance on this seems a little hard nosed but I have to think of the game balance, and weed out things that I feel will cause a great deal of heartache in the Chronicle, and I feel that some of this is unbalanced.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do not worry about it my friend! I totally understand.<br /> <br /> Fixed Char sheet so I'm no longer cheating:<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-YUxBalhBaHVnZ0E/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9d...ew?usp=sharing</a><br /> And updated Legacy w/ the changes you requested + a new optional for Moment of Truth. Let me know if it doesn't work and I'll change it again:<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-LUU5MXNySVRsQWM/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9d...ew?usp=sharing</a><br /> Edit: I also wrote a bit about their philosophy<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1081,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","user":"Fictional Dynasty","date":". 04-15-2017, 11:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","name":"Fictional Dynasty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T09:45:13-07:00","id":1078930,"title":"","content":"Once again, my updated character sheet. <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsMWpReWZicUttbWM\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3...WpReWZicUttbWM</a> I changed skills around and added a praxis. Comments welcome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T10:04:15-07:00","id":1078939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wtaylorjr2001</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1078930#post1078930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Once again, my updated character sheet. <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsMWpReWZicUttbWM\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3...WpReWZicUttbWM</a> I changed skills around and added a praxis. Comments welcome.</div> </div> </div> </div>I love your character concept but you need to work on your aspirations and obsessions. Both your aspirations seem more like obsessions to me. You should have 3 aspirations (two short term, one long) and with gnosis four you get two obsessions. That being said, I like the whole knife-throwing fortuneteller thing.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","name":"Fictional Dynasty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T10:47:20-07:00","id":1078960,"title":"","content":"Thank you <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1081_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1081\" data-vbnamecard=\"1081\">Fictional Dynasty</a> . I rearranged and added aspirations and obsessions. My new character sheet is:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsRjdUanFhbkpGTDQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsRjdUanFhbkpGTDQ\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsRjdUanFhbkpGTDQ\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsRjdUanFhbkpGTDQ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T13:24:44-07:00","id":1079022,"title":"","content":"I am redoing my aspirations. They conflict with someone else's","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T13:37:24-07:00","id":1079026,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wtaylorjr2001</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1079022#post1079022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am redoing my aspirations. They conflict with someone else's</div> </div> </div> </div>Who's do they conflict with?<br /> <br /> Also I'm writing my backstory and I'm wondering if Doctor Luck might have seen the threads of our destiny intertwining and brought us together for that reason?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","name":"Fictional Dynasty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T14:06:58-07:00","id":1079035,"title":"","content":"Yours, we both are writers who seek to awaken sleepers, me with books and you with mass media.<br /> <br /> I think my magic could cause us to meet. I am looking for my sister who vanished a week or so ago. I would use my spells to meet people who could help me to find her. Any strong mage has that ability. Out of character I am thinking vampires got her and are holding her until they are ready to feed on her. I am not a strong combat character. We meet and I tell you a little of my back story. At first I wonder if you had taken her, who knows with fate. There must be something up because my scrying abilities don't work on her. A vampire with obfuscate perhaps, or a mage with prime or fate or time. If we could team up it would be great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T15:15:09-07:00","id":1079071,"title":"","content":"Maybe we can blend aspects of our backgrounds and see what we can create.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T15:20:28-07:00","id":1079073,"title":"","content":"Hello All,<br /> There will be little to no crossover with the other Games so if you have written into your backgrounds, obsession, aspirations, or anywhere please remove them. If there is a crossover you will be approaching it as a mystery and not as something that you know. So the aspiration to have sex with other supernatural creatures goes, you can keep it be do not expect that you will have the opportunity to resolve that aspiration and gain Beats for doing so. As far as the Mage society goes other supernatural creatures do exist but they are way to elusive for occasional or even a rare meeting. Sorry if this causes an issue but I do not know enough about the other supernaturals to run them accurately. They may be an enemy at some point when I learn enough.<br /> <br /> The option is that I put the game on hold until I can learn more about them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T15:50:56-07:00","id":1079092,"title":"","content":"Updated character on a bigger sheet:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-TWRzOGc3RDA0Ylk/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-TWRzOGc3RDA0Ylk/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-TWRzOGc3RDA0Ylk/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-TWRzOGc3RDA0Ylk/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> First Draft of my backstory please ignore any bad spelling or grammar:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-WFhOMURnTUEtWDA/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-WFhOMURnTUEtWDA/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-WFhOMURnTUEtWDA/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9dIfRz2xey-WFhOMURnTUEtWDA/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","name":"Fictional Dynasty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T16:56:43-07:00","id":1079116,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1081_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1081\" data-vbnamecard=\"1081\">Fictional Dynasty</a> you forgot one of your specialties.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T17:32:25-07:00","id":1079131,"title":"","content":"Still working through my character's concept. At first I was thinking of a mage artist, then an occult and crime private eye. However, the sheer utility of Death magic for the latter concept has me moving away from it (I'm not against Death magic per se, but I don't want my character to be focused on that).<br /> <br /> So now I'm considering a character that's actually removed from normal society. I'm still with my family atm, so it'll be a little bit before I can download adobe reader to fill in a sheet like everyone else's (I've been using the character creator offered in one of the mage threads).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T17:57:58-07:00","id":1079135,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7825\" data-vbnamecard=\"7825\">Falcon777</a> Would you consider perhaps a Thyrsus Shaman? They do Spirit and Life. They could also hang out in the woods and stuff. What kind of concept do you want to play? I want a fortunetelling writer. We could use a Thyrsus Healer. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T18:04:35-07:00","id":1079137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HTaiji</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1079116#post1079116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1081_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1081\" data-vbnamecard=\"1081\">Fictional Dynasty</a> you forgot one of your specialties.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you. Fixed it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Falcon777</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1075386-looking-for-a-mage-skype-game?p=1079131#post1079131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Still working through my character's concept. At first I was thinking of a mage artist, then an occult and crime private eye. However, the sheer utility of Death magic for the latter concept has me moving away from it (I'm not against Death magic per se, but I don't want my character to be focused on that).<br /> <br /> So now I'm considering a character that's actually removed from normal society. I'm still with my family atm, so it'll be a little bit before I can download adobe reader to fill in a sheet like everyone else's (I've been using the character creator offered in one of the mage threads).</div> </div> </div> </div>That's fine. I understand it's going to be a wile until Hardwire has a game for us anyway. I'm just doing this because I find myself with some time this weekend and I'm feeling inspired.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1081-fictional-dynasty","name":"Fictional Dynasty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T18:29:23-07:00","id":1079150,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7825\" data-vbnamecard=\"7825\">Falcon777</a> for the concept of the private eye investigator being a Mastigos with Time magic is also a great way of doing it. Mind to know your living witnesses' thoughts, Space to follow the trail of Sympathies and Time to actually be able to see what happened there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T18:41:21-07:00","id":1079154,"title":"","content":"I should have told you why Thyrsus came to mind Falcon777. You can talk to and control spirits. Nature spirits, time spirits, magic spirits, the sky is the limit. Hell I am thinking of changing from Space to Spirit myself. Just my little plug.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T19:54:05-07:00","id":1079184,"title":"","content":"Custom Legacy I wrote for Ignis to tie in with his Obsession:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B0YUp_a_XTCkU3NlX29CSXVpYXM\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B0YUp_a_XTCkU3NlX29CSXVpYXM\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B0YUp_a_XTCkU3NlX29CSXVpYXM\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B0YUp_a_XTCkU3NlX29CSXVpYXM </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T20:22:48-07:00","id":1079199,"title":"","content":"Changed my sheet again to switch Space for Spirit.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsUng0bjZfa3QyWkk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsUng0bjZfa3QyWkk\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B3MaDlLEDWYsUng0bjZfa3Qy